{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008550/extras/8df9cdaf0939310071f567b26c37c5b5.avif?t=1762387852\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008550/extras_big/8df9cdaf0939310071f567b26c37c5b5.webp?t=1762387852 width=1560 height=439 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hamstory</strong> is a <strong>2D pixel art platformer</strong> that offers both emotional depth and challenging gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey with 'Hamcho' to the distant <strong>Haessi Star</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will gather your strength to leap, experience the occasional fall, and learn to get back up again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Falling is not a failure, but a part of the growing process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Converse with warm-hearted animal friends, listen to their tales,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and discover the true meaning of a challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump to the Next Level!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press and hold the jump button to charge your power, then time your release to make a great leap. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A small mistake can lead to a long fall, but that's okay. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lessons learned from falling will guide you to even greater heights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008550/extras/f3bcf900cde66d50b61fc4da8f8b5de9.poster.avif?t=1762387852\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008550/extras/f3bcf900cde66d50b61fc4da8f8b5de9.webm?t=1762387852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008550/extras/f3bcf900cde66d50b61fc4da8f8b5de9.mp4?t=1762387852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Journey with Animal Villagers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't worry if you fall. The villagers' warm words of comfort will be there for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help them with their requests to learn new jumping skills,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and uncover the hidden stories behind each of their lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heartfelt Pixel Graphics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With full pixel art drawn by mouse and detailed animations,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >we have brought a world of tiny, breathing creatures to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008550/extras/927e7ae4630bacd8c7708a18eabe6c98.poster.avif?t=1762387852\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008550/extras/927e7ae4630bacd8c7708a18eabe6c98.webm?t=1762387852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008550/extras/927e7ae4630bacd8c7708a18eabe6c98.mp4?t=1762387852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World Alive with Seasons</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The journey in Hamstory flows with the changing of the seasons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a world in flux with new maps and effects for each season.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008550/extras/1df36c7e8a68461e913cdfe2da488a09.poster.avif?t=1762387852\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008550/extras/1df36c7e8a68461e913cdfe2da488a09.webm?t=1762387852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008550/extras/1df36c7e8a68461e913cdfe2da488a09.mp4?t=1762387852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>We're Cheering for Your Challenge!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until the moment you reach Haessi Star,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >create your own story through repeated falls and leaps.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4008550?t=1762387852","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4008550?t=1762387852","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008550/18875cf8c130a97515752f2413036f71cb5a8ac9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762387852","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008550/18875cf8c130a97515752f2413036f71cb5a8ac9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762387852","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4088390,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://share